      "id": "claim_ba1f094eca0e43cba99ea73d3347454a",
      "statement": "POST /api/tasks authenticates the caller with getServerSession (401 if no session), enforces a per-user daily cap via checkRateLimit (429 with remaining/total/resetAt), validates the body with insertTaskSchema, and inserts a tasks row at status='pending', progress=0, logs=[] before any work is scheduled.",
