      "statement": "The generateBranchName and generateTaskTitle after() callbacks each early-return when AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY is unset, and otherwise call generateText via the ai SDK with model 'openai/gpt-5-nano' through Vercel AI Gateway; on failure each writes a deterministic fallback to the row (createFallbackBranchName produces 'agent/<iso-timestamp>-<id8>' and createFallbackTitle returns the trimmed prompt).",
