    {
      "id": "claim_45b2477ce7004c61bb7a463b47232f87",
      "statement": "executeAgentInSandbox applies a temp-env-var pattern: it snapshots OPENAI_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, CURSOR_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY, GH_TOKEN, and GITHUB_TOKEN into originalEnv, writes the per-user keys into process.env, dispatches to the per-agent module, and restores the originals in a finally block so one user's keys cannot leak into the next user's run.",
