      "statement": "The keepAlive flag has exactly one effect on the worker: when true, processTask skips the unregisterSandbox + shutdownSandbox pair after pushChangesToBranch (and after a failed processTask), leaving sandboxId and sandboxUrl on the row for a later Sandbox.get reconnect; it does not affect the SDK timeout that bounds the sandbox lifetime.",
