      "statement": "useTask has a three-layer polling state machine: an initial fetch followed by up to three retries every 2 seconds (to absorb the create-then-navigate race); a steady-state poll every 5 seconds; and an accelerated 500 ms refetch when the task's logs contain 'Development server is running' or 'Development server started' but sandboxUrl is still null, so the preview iframe renders as soon as the VM exposes the dev server.",
